# Dev feedback log — local iteration chatter, not project history.
# Anchored to the root: an unanchored `feedback/` also swallows
# app/dev/feedback/, which is source.
/feedback/

# NOTE: public/media/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The sources are 12-29 GB
# ProRes files on local drives that CI can never see, so if the derived web
# assets aren't committed, every deploy ships a site with missing media.
# Commit the derived files; never the sources. See plans/media.md — if this
# grows past ~100 MB, move it to R2 rather than reaching for Git LFS.

# Misc
*.tsbuildinfo
